1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,439
WiFi full!… tapi kenapa satu website pun
tak boleh buka?!

2
00:00:04,739 --> 00:00:06,045
Bayangkan.

3
00:00:05,845 --> 00:00:11,504
Internet ada, WiFi pun ada… tapi semua
website dekat dunia, down.

4
00:00:11,504 --> 00:00:12,398
Nak Google?

5
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:13,738
Tak boleh...

6
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:14,599
Nak shopping?

7
00:00:14,785 --> 00:00:15,738
Pun tak boleh...

8
00:00:15,944 --> 00:00:17,355
asyik loading je...

9
00:00:17,355 --> 00:00:18,532
Nak hantar assignment?

10
00:00:18,332 --> 00:00:21,030
Student portal pun tak boleh nak bukak...

11
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,548
Office pun terhenti.

12
00:00:22,819 --> 00:00:26,399
Email tak masuk, meeting online pun semua
terputus.

13
00:00:26,399 --> 00:00:30,717
Dan yang paling pelik… banyak apps dalam
phone pun down jugak.

14
00:00:30,667 --> 00:00:33,504
Eh, apasal apps pun kena?

15
00:00:33,504 --> 00:00:38,241
Sebab setiap kali kau buka website atau
app, phone kau akan hantar request.

16
00:00:38,041 --> 00:00:42,263
Dia cari alamat server dulu… lepas tu
ketuk pintu dia.

17
00:00:42,263 --> 00:00:47,427
Biasanya, server tu yang akan hantar balik
gambar, video, harga barang.

18
00:00:47,227 --> 00:00:48,326
Semua la.

19
00:00:48,326 --> 00:00:53,156
Tapi kalau server pun tak jawab… browser
hanya cuma boleh tunjuk satu

20
00:00:52,956 --> 00:00:54,348
benda je...

21
00:00:54,148 --> 00:00:54,752
Error.

22
00:00:54,902 --> 00:00:59,592
Ohh… maksudnya internet tu ibarat macam
jalan,

23
00:00:59,392 --> 00:01:01,936
and website tu pulak kedai?

24
00:01:01,936 --> 00:01:03,025
Tepat sekali.

25
00:01:02,825 --> 00:01:05,774
Jalan elok je, tapi semua kedai tutup.

26
00:01:05,574 --> 00:01:08,990
So website apa yang paling banyak korang
bukak?

27
00:01:08,790 --> 00:01:10,102
Komen bawah.
